 "title": "GOMC Monte Carlo: Wolf summation and force fields",
 "summary": "The owner's work in the GPU-Optimized Monte Carlo (GOMC) lab: a derivation of the intramolecular and self terms of the Wolf (DSF/DSP) electrostatics, an experiment plan for its accuracy and timing on CPU and GPU, a sanity sheet comparing Ewald against five Wolf variants with Welch t-tests (relative errors 0.05 to 0.5 percent, most differences significant), block-averaged energy outputs, the lab's particle-swarm force-field optimisation decks and a parallel tempering code archive. The analysis is underway; the derivation ends with an open check on the cutoff.",
